<title>USA: Fix-Corp gets $7 mln loan facility.</title>
<headline>Fix-Corp gets $7 mln loan facility.</headline>
<dateline>BEACHWOOD, Ohio 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fix-Corp International Inc said  Friday it has obtained a $7,000,000 loan facility from NationsCredit Commercial Corp, a unit  NationsBank Corp. The package, said the company, includes permanent financing, equipment acquisition facility, as well as an inventory and account receivable credit line.</p>
</text>
